        {
          "id": "91c6bff5-bcd6-4f66-90d9-2fa8aa5bf02f",
          "name": "Unified money-movement feed for the broker's Transactions tab.",
          "request": {
            "name": "Unified money-movement feed for the broker's Transactions tab.",
            "description": {
              "content": "GET /apis/v2/treasury/activity?type=&limit=&offset=\n\nMerges three sources into one date-ordered list:\n\n* Treasury FA transactions (except payout rows — see below), which carry\n  regulatory receipts (``has_receipt``, fetched via\n  ``/treasury/transactions/{id}/receipt``);\n* payouts of the payments balance (from StripePayout, so payouts to the\n  broker's own external bank are included; the payout rows mirrored in\n  the FA ledger are excluded to avoid listing the same payout twice);\n* Connect transfers of collected premiums into the broker's account.\n\n``type`` filters to one row type: a Treasury object type, ``payout``,\nor ``transfer``.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "v2",
                "treasury",
                "activity"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": []
            },
